00:45:55.570 --> 00:45:58.070
I want to point out that
this is as opposed to much,

00:45:58.070 --> 00:46:00.140
much, much worse things like,

00:46:00.140 --> 00:46:02.650
what's usually known as
the tragedy of the commons,

00:46:02.650 --> 00:46:03.925
where the degradation is,

00:46:03.925 --> 00:46:07.400
degrades with more participants,
the worse you'd get.

00:46:07.400 --> 00:46:11.110
Price of anarchy formally
defined as follows,

00:46:11.110 --> 00:46:13.725
classically it's about
