00:46:13.725 --> 00:46:15.310
They take the utility of Nash

00:46:15.310 --> 00:46:16.975
and compare it to the optimum.

00:46:16.975 --> 00:46:19.655
Then a sequence of

00:46:19.655 --> 00:46:23.400
