00:46:26.920 --> 00:46:30.500
got generalized to
learning outcomes.

00:46:30.500 --> 00:46:32.235
What they said is,

00:46:32.235 --> 00:46:35.190
we repeated the same game
capital T times,

00:46:35.190 --> 00:46:38.220
take the utilities of
the player summed over time,

00:46:38.220 --> 00:46:41.380
and compare it T
times the optimum.

00:46:41.380 --> 00:46:44.525
At that point the game and
the players were stable,

00:46:44.525 --> 00:46:46.190
